  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut sweet potato into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place sweet potato on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. Allow to cool slightly. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the sweet potato between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-649a86e82897e41b2e1e0610-e68ff394.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, remove centre veins from makrut lime leaves, then very finely chop.\n• Grate carrot.\n• In a small bowl, combine makrut leaves, mixed sesame seeds, sweet chilli sauce, ginger paste, the water and half the soy sauce.\n• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat. Cook sweet-chilli ginger mixture until heated through and fragrant, 1 minute. Transfer to a medium bowl and set aside. TIP: The makrut leaves are fibrous so make sure to cut them into very small pieces!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-649a86e82897e41b2e1e0610-28063017.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, pat firm tofu (see ingredients) dry, then cut into 1cm pieces.\n• In a second medium bowl, combine cornflour (see ingredients) and a generous pinch of salt and pepper. Add tofu, tossing to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-649a86e82897e41b2e1e0610-1039039e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When sweet potato has 5 minutes remaining, wipe out frying pan and return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• When oil is hot, shake the excess cornflour off tofu, then cook tofu, turning occasionally, until golden, 5-7 minutes. TIP: For best results, cook the tofu in batches if your pan is getting crowded.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-649a86e82897e41b2e1e0610-8081de55.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a third medium bowl, combine sesame dressing, the vinegar, the remaining soy sauce and a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Add shredded wombok, baby spinach leaves, carrot and roasted sweet potato. Toss to coat and season to taste.\n• To bowl with sweet-chilli ginger mixture, add cooked tofu, tossing to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-649a86e82897e41b2e1e0610-4c5d60db.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide sweet potato and wombok salad between plates.\n• Top with golden sweet chilli-makrut tofu.\n• Sprinkle with crunchy fried noodles to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-649a86e82897e41b2e1e0610-3962fa87.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
